Tracing: SDD

Purpose:
  Defines distributed tracing policy and trace structure.

TraceStructure:
  TraceID: Unique per request, propagated across services
  SpanID: Unique per operation, parent-child relationship
  Context: service, operation, start_time, end_time, duration,
           status, tags, logs

Propagation:
  HTTP: X-Trace-ID header
  gRPC: metadata propagation
  Message queues: message headers

Sampling:
  Development: 100%
  Production: 1-10% (configurable)
  Errors: 100% for error traces

CodeTraceMapping:
  trace → service → component → task

LatencyAnalysis:
  - Identify slow spans
  - Compare against baseline
  - Detect regressions

Rules:
  [TR1] Every request MUST have trace_id.
  [TR2] Trace MUST span all services.
  [TR3] Trace MUST include stage information.

State: +